 "Module 11 covers unsupervised discovery of themes at scale: LDA (Gensim/MALLET), NMF, and the modern default pipeline BERTopic (embeddings, UMAP/HDBSCAN, class-based TF-IDF) plus dynamic/stt variants for time and metadata. It trains students to validate topics with coherence metrics and human reading, and to use topics for framing and agenda analysis rather than decorative word clouds.",
 3,
