 ["C3 Run LDA and BERTopic on a corpus and compare topics", "C4 Validate topics with coherence and human coding", "C5 Interpret topic prevalence over time for a real issue"],
 ["LDA (Gensim/MALLET), NMF (sklearn), BERTopic, STM/dynamic topic models, coherence (C_v, NPMI)",
  "Topic prevalence estimation time series"],
 "Coherence (C_v, NPMI), stability across seeds, human agreement on topic assignment, silhouette for clusters",
 "Number-of-topics arbitrariness, topic drift across data windows, seed instability, word clouds mistaken for meaning, hubness of embeddings",
 "gensim, mallet, bertopic, umap-learn, hdbscan, scikit-learn; R: stm, topicmodels",
