 "Two topic models on one corpus, coherence comparison, then human validation of 30 documents per topic",
 "News/social corpus on a public issue; parliamentary/policy corpus for STM",
 ["Silge & Robinson, Text Mining with R, ch. 6", "Blei, Ng, Jordan (2003) LDA paper", "Grootendorst (2022) BERTopic paper"],
