 "Module 12 builds the general NLP toolkit used by all later modules: pretrained transformers (BERT/RoBERTa/DeBERTa/XLM-R), Hugging Face fine-tuning and evaluation, sentence embeddings (SBERT/KataBERT/BGE multilingual), dense retrieval and vector stores, zero-shot classification, and practical constraints (CPU/Colab budgets, quantization, small-student-lab reality). Emphasis on evaluation rigor and calibration, not just accuracy.",
