 "Public cascade data (X/Bluesky topic cascades, imitation dataset)",
 ["Zafarani et al., Social Media Mining, ch. on diffusion", "Barabasi, Network Science, ch. on epidemic spreading", "Goel et al. (2016) 'The structural virality of online diffusion'"],
 ["2024-2026 papers on prediction of virality and on recommender-driven spread"],
 "2024-2026: algorithm-driven feeds (TikTok For You) made pure 'organic virality' modelling harder; analysis now separates creator-side from platform-side amplification",
